test.yaml:11:16: this step checks out code from a pull request (github.event.pull_request.head.sha) in a "pull_request_target" workflow and "npm" runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data [untrusted-checkout]
test.yaml:19:16: this step checks out code from a pull request (refs/pull/${{ github.event.number }}/merge) in a "pull_request_target" workflow and "make" runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data [untrusted-checkout]
test.yaml:27:9: this step checks out code from a pull request (gh pr checkout) in a "pull_request_target" workflow and "test.sh" runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data [untrusted-checkout]
